WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Here´s what people
are talking about.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
I saw this morning,
President Trump tweeted

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.140
that his border wall is going
to be built out of old fences.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:10.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which explains why today
millions of Americans

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
walked out
of their homes and said,

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Where the hell´s my fence?"
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:18.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I´m building
a chain-link fence."

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:21.788
Trump also went on Twitter to
criticize Hillary´s new book.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.056
So she responded by saying

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:25.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
she´d send him a copy of her
children´s book instead.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:29.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump was like,
"Got anything shorter?"

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:31.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter and applause ]
"I´ll take the book.

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.933
I´ll take the kids book."

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
Meanwhile,
Ivanka Trump said that

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:37.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
she doesn´t speak out
against her dad publicly

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
because when you´re
part of a team,

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:40.774 size:81% position:41%
you´re part of a team.

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:42.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think what
she meant to say was,

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:44.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
"When you´re part of a will,
you´re part of a will."

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.279 size:84% position:42%
I mean, it´s just --
It´s just common sense.

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:48.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
You got to think about it.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:49.349 size:78% position:39%
-This is big, though.

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:50.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
After meeting
with Democratic leaders,

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:54.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
it seems like Trump
changed his mind on DACA.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.655 size:75% position:38%
Democrats were like,
"Yeah, we told him

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:57.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
it stood for for
Doughnuts Across America.

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:59.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
So he was like,
"Oh, I love doughnuts."

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:00.326
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:01.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
But everyone
is talking about DACA.

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:03.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
A couple weeks ago, Trump said
that he was ending it.

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:06.366
Now he seems like he´s working
with Democrats to replace it.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
Nobody knows
what´s gonna happen.

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:09.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
And obviously, a lot
of immigrants are concerned.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:11.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
So here to talk to us
a little more about the issue

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:14.574
is "Tonight Show" correspondent
Julio Torres.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:19.379 size:84% position:42% line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:22.248 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
-Hi, hi, hi.
Hello, Jimmy. Hi.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Hi, Julio.

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:25.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, why don´t you tell us
a little bit about yourself.

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:28.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sure.
My name is Julio.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:31.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was born and raised
as a brunette.

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.360 size:78% position:39%
I´m from El Salvador.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.895 align:start size:94% position:6%
I live in Brooklyn.

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:39.866
I´m an Aquarius,
and my favorite color is clear.

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:40.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Great, great.

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:44.771
And we just want to confirm
that you´re a real-live person.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:47.140
You´re not some funny, weird
character that we made up.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.175
-No, yes, correct, I am real.

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:50.677
But I am not an American,

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:53.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
though I´m very, very fond
of this country.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:56.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
I grew up in El Salvador
watching a lot of American TV.

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:58.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s part of the reason
why I´m fluent in English now.

00:01:58.685 --> 00:02:01.221
Like so many
little gay boys in El Salvador,

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:04.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
I could only dream of maybe,
just maybe,

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:07.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
meeting Ally McBeal one day.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I hope you do.
I´ve met her. She´s great.

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:10.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I haven´t.
-Yeah.

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:13.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I came from a tiny,
tiny Central American country

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:14.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
and look at me now.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:16.836 size:81% position:41%
I´m part of the, um...

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:20.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
<i>Como se dice...?
[ Laughter ]</i>

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
Liberal media elite?
-Yeah, good.

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:25.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, Julio, what do you think
of the notions

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:28.581
that illegal immigrants steal
jobs from American workers?

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:32.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I´m a stand-up comedian
but not just any kind.

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:35.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m the sort of
a queer multimedia kind.

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:37.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, true.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The other day, I was covered
completely in glitter,

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
holding
a little crystal pyramid,

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:44.230
wondering how to incorporate it
into my act, and I thought,

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, I´m sorry.

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:48.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is this
one of the many good jobs

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:50.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m stealing
from hardworking Americans?"

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:52.739
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:56.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
That´s interesting.

00:02:56.276 --> 00:02:59.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Am I supposed to be viewed
as a threat somehow?

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:01.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look, I´m not here
because of DACA.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:03.483 size:81% position:41%
My path was different.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:07.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
I am here under a visa
that claims that I am an alien

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.023
of extraordinary ability.

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:11.891
Pause for laughter or applause.

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:16.429
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:18.264 size:78% position:39%
Thank you, thank you.

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:21.701
I think this will all work out,
but it´s just frustrating

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:24.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we keep having
these conversations,

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.539
immigrant or Dreamer or illegal.

00:03:26.539 --> 00:03:29.709 size:81% position:41%
These are broad labels
composed of very real,

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:32.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
unique people with their own
hopes and dreams.

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:37.417
Today, I´m a legal little
space twink, but tomorrow,

00:03:37.417 --> 00:03:40.186
I could be just another
bad hombre on my way out.

00:03:40.186 --> 00:03:43.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:46.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump keeps changing his mind
on this, and I get it.

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:48.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
We all have a little angel
on one shoulder

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:50.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a Cabinet full
of racist devils on another.

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:59.973
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:02.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, the only person
I connect with

00:04:02.275 --> 00:04:04.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
in this administration
is Melania,

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:07.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
because just like me,
she´s foreign,

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:10.183
she´s a beautiful ice princess,

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:12.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we both scan the room
for the nearest exit

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:14.420
whenever we read to children.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:18.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.258 --> 00:04:22.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look, look, I really
want to stay in America,

00:04:22.662 --> 00:04:23.997
but if this doesn´t work out,

00:04:23.997 --> 00:04:25.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
I guess I´ll just marry
a billionaire

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:26.633 size:81% position:41%
and become First Lady.

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:29.569 size:88% position:44%
-Julio Torres, everyone!

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:31.070 size:88% position:44%
Julio, thank you, buddy!

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:33.439 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:36.509
Julio, thank you for being here.

00:04:36.509 --> 00:04:38.144
Guys, this was going viral.

00:04:38.144 --> 00:04:41.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yesterday, Trump wore
a blue jacket with black pants

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:43.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
to a meeting
on race relations.

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:45.485 size:78% position:39%
Take a look at this.
This is very -- yeah.

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:47.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.423
Trump was like,
"I told you, I don´t see color."

00:04:50.423 --> 00:04:54.861
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:54.861 --> 00:04:57.363
And people are still talking
about this Ted Cruz scandal

00:04:57.363 --> 00:05:00.767
where his Twitter account liked
a pornographic video.

00:05:00.767 --> 00:05:02.869
And he´s been blaming his staff
for the incident,

00:05:02.869 --> 00:05:04.837
and I think that they´re
getting a little fed up with it.

00:05:04.837 --> 00:05:06.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can kind of hear them
in the background

00:05:06.706 --> 00:05:08.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
during this interview.
Listen close.

00:05:08.207 --> 00:05:12.679 line:0%
-Your Twitter handle liked
a post that was clearly porn.

00:05:12.679 --> 00:05:13.713 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
What happened?

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:16.049 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
-Look, it was --
We had a staffer

00:05:16.049 --> 00:05:18.184 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
who accidentally
hit the wrong button.

00:05:18.184 --> 00:05:19.485 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
-No! That was you.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:20.753 size:84% position:42% line:0%
-And it was a screw-up.

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:22.088 size:81% position:41% line:0%
-You screwed yourself!

00:05:22.088 --> 00:05:24.724 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
-As soon as we found out about
it, we pulled it down.

00:05:24.724 --> 00:05:26.859 line:0%
-Oh, you pulled it, all right!

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:28.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
You see what I´m saying?

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:29.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was --
No, yeah.

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:32.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, that´s...

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:33.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Cruz.

00:05:33.466 --> 00:05:34.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, Target announced
that it will hire

00:05:34.901 --> 00:05:37.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
100,000 seasonal employees
during the holidays.

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
10 of them will be
on the register.

00:05:39.138 --> 00:05:40.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
The rest
will wander around saying,

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I don´t work
in this department."

00:05:41.741 --> 00:05:43.376
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:43.376 --> 00:05:45.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I just need --
Who does?"

00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:48.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
"They´re in
the other department."

00:05:48.114 --> 00:05:50.216
And, finally, I read about
a brother and sister in Michigan

00:05:50.216 --> 00:05:53.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
who reunited
after 50 years apart.

00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:54.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
Unfortunately,
it was on Tinder.

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:55.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Audience groans ]

00:05:55.922 --> 00:05:57.056
We have a great show tonight.

00:05:57.056 --> 00:05:58.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
Give it up for The Roots,
everybody.

